      "message": "Give facts their names, rebuild Explore, and fix the members rows\n\nExplore was a list whose one row put the repository's name in the\navatar's column and cut it to a letter, under a heading the page head\nalready carried. It is now a page of cards: who owns it, what it is\nfor, what it is filed under, and three numbers with their names, landed\nthis week, open, and the share a runner reproduced; a search box, an\norder (busiest, newest, most reproduced, name) and a topic bar with\ncounts sit above, and the API takes the same q and sort.\n\nThe organisation's member rows wrapped their actions into the avatar's\ncolumn, so \"Make member\" and \"Remove\" showed as fragments; the row now\nhas a column for the role and one for the actions, and the add and\ninvite forms are two small labelled panels instead of one strip with a\nparagraph beside it.\n\nEverywhere a line jammed facts together with dots, the facts now carry\ntheir names: model, harness and holder on an agent; by, revision and\nopened on a change; filed, version and about on a report; commit and by\non a tag; revision, status and replies on a thread; lines and language\non a file; the coverage headers. Agent cards share a height and keep\ntheir actions in a menu; the add-agent form has its own panel. Long\nhints on the organisation page are one line each.\n\nTask: t-7cc2jf83rx7jsdq1t9z8tx6e06\nChange-Id: Iclean0138\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
